---
import {
  constrainedOuterMinimum,
  constrainedUniversal,
  sampleConstrainedCurves,
} from '../../../data/part02/ch06TeachingModels.mjs';

const initialSlope = -0.2;
const initialTrial = 0.4;
const initialInner = constrainedUniversal(initialTrial);
const initialOuter = constrainedOuterMinimum(initialSlope);
const initialSamples = sampleConstrainedCurves(initialSlope);

const qToX = (q) => 55 + 520 * (q + 1) / 2;
const energyToY = (energy) => 260 - 205 * (energy - 0.1) / 1.7;
const pathFor = (key) => initialSamples
  .map((point, index) => `${index === 0 ? 'M' : 'L'} ${qToX(point.q).toFixed(2)} ${energyToY(point[key]).toFixed(2)}`)
  .join(' ');
---

<figure class="chapter-visual constrained-search" data-constrained-search>
  <figcaption>
    <strong>原创交互模型：约束搜索的内层与外层极小化</strong>
    <span lang="en">Original interactive model: inner and outer minimization in constrained search</span>
  </figcaption>

  <div class="chapter-visual__controls">
    <label>
      <span>试探密度坐标 q | Trial density coordinate</span>
      <input type="range" min="-1" max="1" step="0.01" value={initialTrial} data-cs-trial />
      <output data-cs-trial-output>{initialTrial.toFixed(2)}</output>
    </label>
    <label>
      <span>外势斜率 u | External-potential slope</span>
      <input type="range" min="-0.5" max="0.5" step="0.01" value={initialSlope} data-cs-slope />
      <output data-cs-slope-output>{initialSlope.toFixed(2)}</output>
    </label>
  </div>

  <svg viewBox="0 0 630 310" role="img" aria-labelledby="cs-title cs-desc">
    <title id="cs-title">Finite constrained-search teaching model</title>
    <desc id="cs-desc">Two candidate internal-energy families are minimized at fixed density coordinate to form a universal functional, after which an external linear term is added and minimized over density.</desc>
    <line x1="55" y1="260" x2="575" y2="260" class="plot-axis" />
    <line x1="55" y1="35" x2="55" y2="260" class="plot-axis" />
    <path d={pathFor('familyA')} class="cs-family cs-family--a" data-cs-family-a />
    <path d={pathFor('familyB')} class="cs-family cs-family--b" data-cs-family-b />
    <path d={pathFor('universal')} class="cs-universal" data-cs-universal />
    <path d={pathFor('total')} class="cs-total" data-cs-total />
    <line x1={qToX(initialTrial)} y1="35" x2={qToX(initialTrial)} y2="260" class="plot-guide" data-cs-trial-line />
    <circle cx={qToX(initialOuter.q)} cy={energyToY(initialOuter.energy)} r="6" class="cs-minimum" data-cs-minimum />
    <text x="575" y="287" text-anchor="end">q</text>
    <text x="24" y="45">energy</text>
    <text x="55" y="282" text-anchor="middle">−1</text>
    <text x="315" y="282" text-anchor="middle">0</text>
    <text x="575" y="282" text-anchor="middle">1</text>
  </svg>

  <ul class="cs-legend" aria-label="Curve legend">
    <li><span class="cs-key cs-key--a"></span>A(q)</li>
    <li><span class="cs-key cs-key--b"></span>B(q)</li>
    <li><span class="cs-key cs-key--universal"></span>F(q) = min[A,B]</li>
    <li><span class="cs-key cs-key--total"></span>F(q) + uq</li>
  </ul>

  <div class="chapter-visual__readout" aria-live="polite">
    <span data-cs-inner>At q = {initialTrial.toFixed(2)}: F = {initialInner.value.toFixed(4)} from family {initialInner.family}</span>
    <strong data-cs-outer>Outer minimum: q = {initialOuter.q.toFixed(4)}, family {initialOuter.family}, E = {initialOuter.energy.toFixed(4)}</strong>
  </div>

  <div class="chapter-visual__contract">
    <p><strong>模型：</strong>用一个密度坐标 $q\in[-1,1]$ 代替连续密度。固定 $q$ 时，两类候选态的内部能量为 $A(q)=0.55+0.8q^2$ 与 $B(q)=0.62+0.15(q-0.65)^2$；内层搜索定义 $F(q)=\min(A,B)$。外层搜索最小化 $F(q)+uq$。所有能量均为无量纲模型单位。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Model:</strong> a scalar coordinate $q\in[-1,1]$ replaces a continuous density. The inner search selects the lower of two candidate-state energies; the outer search minimizes the resulting universal function plus $uq$.</p>
    <p><strong>验收：</strong>任意 $q$ 下显示的 $F$ 必须等于 A、B 中较小者；$u=0$ 时外层最小值为 $q=0$、族 A、$E=0.55$；报告的外层最小值必须不高于两个族各自受边界约束的极小值。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Acceptance:</strong> displayed $F$ must equal the lower candidate at every $q$; at $u=0$, the outer minimum is $q=0$, family A, and $E=0.55$; the reported outer result must equal the lower of the two boundary-constrained family minima.</p>
    <p><strong>边界：</strong>该模型只保存“先固定密度搜索状态，再对密度搜索”的嵌套结构。它没有反对称多电子波函数、Coulomb 相互作用、连续函数空间或真实材料参数。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Boundary:</strong> the model preserves only the nested logic of searching states at fixed density and then searching densities. It contains no antisymmetric many-electron wavefunctions, Coulomb interaction, continuous function space, or material parameters.</p>
  </div>
</figure>

<script>
  import {
    constrainedOuterMinimum,
    constrainedUniversal,
    sampleConstrainedCurves,
  } from '../../../data/part02/ch06TeachingModels.mjs';

  document.querySelectorAll('[data-constrained-search]').forEach((root) => {
    const trialInput = root.querySelector('[data-cs-trial]');
    const slopeInput = root.querySelector('[data-cs-slope]');
    const trialOutput = root.querySelector('[data-cs-trial-output]');
    const slopeOutput = root.querySelector('[data-cs-slope-output]');
    const innerOutput = root.querySelector('[data-cs-inner]');
    const outerOutput = root.querySelector('[data-cs-outer]');
    const trialLine = root.querySelector('[data-cs-trial-line]');
    const minimum = root.querySelector('[data-cs-minimum]');
    const familyAPath = root.querySelector('[data-cs-family-a]');
    const familyBPath = root.querySelector('[data-cs-family-b]');
    const universalPath = root.querySelector('[data-cs-universal]');
    const totalPath = root.querySelector('[data-cs-total]');

    if (!(trialInput instanceof HTMLInputElement) || !(slopeInput instanceof HTMLInputElement)) return;
    if (!(trialLine instanceof SVGLineElement) || !(minimum instanceof SVGCircleElement)) return;

    const qToX = (q) => 55 + 520 * (q + 1) / 2;
    const energyToY = (energy) => 260 - 205 * (energy - 0.1) / 1.7;
    const pathFor = (samples, key) => samples
      .map((point, index) => `${index === 0 ? 'M' : 'L'} ${qToX(point.q).toFixed(2)} ${energyToY(point[key]).toFixed(2)}`)
      .join(' ');

    const update = () => {
      const trial = Number(trialInput.value);
      const slope = Number(slopeInput.value);
      const inner = constrainedUniversal(trial);
      const outer = constrainedOuterMinimum(slope);
      const samples = sampleConstrainedCurves(slope);

      trialLine.setAttribute('x1', qToX(trial).toFixed(2));
      trialLine.setAttribute('x2', qToX(trial).toFixed(2));
      minimum.setAttribute('cx', qToX(outer.q).toFixed(2));
      minimum.setAttribute('cy', energyToY(outer.energy).toFixed(2));

      if (familyAPath instanceof SVGPathElement) familyAPath.setAttribute('d', pathFor(samples, 'familyA'));
      if (familyBPath instanceof SVGPathElement) familyBPath.setAttribute('d', pathFor(samples, 'familyB'));
      if (universalPath instanceof SVGPathElement) universalPath.setAttribute('d', pathFor(samples, 'universal'));
      if (totalPath instanceof SVGPathElement) totalPath.setAttribute('d', pathFor(samples, 'total'));

      if (trialOutput instanceof HTMLOutputElement) trialOutput.value = trial.toFixed(2);
      if (slopeOutput instanceof HTMLOutputElement) slopeOutput.value = slope.toFixed(2);
      if (innerOutput instanceof HTMLElement) innerOutput.textContent = `At q = ${trial.toFixed(2)}: F = ${inner.value.toFixed(4)} from family ${inner.family}`;
      if (outerOutput instanceof HTMLElement) outerOutput.textContent = `Outer minimum: q = ${outer.q.toFixed(4)}, family ${outer.family}, E = ${outer.energy.toFixed(4)}`;
    };

    trialInput.addEventListener('input', update);
    slopeInput.addEventListener('input', update);
    update();
  });
</script>

<style>
  .constrained-search svg {
    width: 100%;
    max-height: 24rem;
  }

  .cs-family,
  .cs-universal,
  .cs-total {
    fill: none;
    stroke-width: 2.5;
  }

  .cs-family--a {
    stroke: var(--sl-color-gray-3);
    stroke-dasharray: 8 5;
  }

  .cs-family--b {
    stroke: var(--sl-color-gray-4);
    stroke-dasharray: 3 5;
  }

  .cs-universal {
    stroke: var(--sl-color-text-accent);
    stroke-width: 4;
  }

  .cs-total {
    stroke: var(--sl-color-accent-high);
    stroke-width: 3;
  }

  .cs-minimum {
    fill: var(--sl-color-accent-high);
    stroke: currentColor;
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }

  .constrained-search text {
    fill: currentColor;
  }

  .cs-legend {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.45rem 1rem;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .cs-key {
    display: inline-block;
    width: 1.8rem;
    margin-right: 0.35rem;
    border-top: 3px solid currentColor;
    vertical-align: middle;
  }

  .cs-key--a { border-top-style: dashed; color: var(--sl-color-gray-3); }
  .cs-key--b { border-top-style: dotted; color: var(--sl-color-gray-4); }
  .cs-key--universal { color: var(--sl-color-text-accent); }
  .cs-key--total { color: var(--sl-color-accent-high); }
</style>
